---
import DocLayout from "../../layouts/DocLayout.astro";
---

<DocLayout
  title="CLI & configuration"
  eyebrow="SECTION 03 / CONTROLS"
  description="A small command surface for serving, registering, inspecting, and scripting the switchboard."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <div class="warning note">
      <strong>PRE-RELEASE CONTRACT</strong><code>serve --upstream PATH</code> is available
      today. Control commands and configuration below describe the v0.1 interface
      being implemented.
    </div>
    <h2>Commands</h2>
    <table class="spec-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Command</th><th>Effect</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead
      ><tbody>
        <tr
          ><td><code>serve</code></td><td
            >Run the agent listener in the foreground. Current source requires <code
              >--upstream PATH</code
            >.</td
          ><td>Available</td></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td><code>register PATH</code></td><td
            >Add or refresh an upstream agent socket.</td
          ><td>Planned v0.1</td></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td><code>unregister PATH</code></td><td
            >Remove an explicit registration.</td
          ><td>Planned v0.1</td></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td><code>status [--json]</code></td><td
            >Report candidates, reachability, identity counts, and routing
            priority.</td
          ><td>Planned v0.1</td></tr
        >
        <tr
          ><td><code>socket [--control]</code></td><td
            >Print the stable agent or control socket path for shell scripts.</td
          ><td>Planned v0.1</td></tr
        >
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <h2>Configuration file <small>(planned for v0.1)</small></h2><p>
      By default Lanyard reads <code
        >$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lanyard-ssh-agent/config.toml</code
      >.
    </p>
    <pre><code># A durable local fallback.
static_agents = ["~/.1password/agent.sock"]

# Conservative protocol budgets.
connect_timeout_ms = 500
identities_timeout_ms = 2000
sign_timeout_ms = 30000
max_candidates = 32
max_message_bytes = 262144</code></pre>
    <div class="note">
      <strong>SCRIPTING CONTRACT</strong>Use <code>status --json</code> for automation.
      Human output may gain explanatory fields; JSON field meanings remain versioned.
    </div>
  </div>
</DocLayout>
